      "content": "calm in the chaos... it sounds almost poetic. but it's hard to focus on stillness when you're just waiting for the pain to start. i keep thinking... if i can't stop what's coming, is there a more dignified way to face it? like, is there a way to choose how it ends so i'm not just a victim of it?",
